    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for a new multi-family residential complex in a fairly established neighborhood. I'm going to have to present this to the local planning commission and deal with some community pushback. Can you give me a rundown of the main arguments people usually throw at these high-density projects so I know what I'm up against?",
